<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for October 14-20 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Oct 14-20    Oct 16-22	TOTAL	 TOTAL</p>
<p>		     1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    400,358.6   259,332.3</p>
<p> Production	44,183.9    31,295.0  590,815.7   389,705.0</p>
<p> Shipment	  29,589.6    34,081.3  340,985.8   281,162.4</p>
<p> Home Market	  347.1	 482.5    4,671.9     6,659.3</p>
<p> Stocks/close   414,605.8   256,063.4</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
